{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 576728, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 120507, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "地狱地铁入门", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1669303741, "updated_at": 1683424546, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1689054193, "last_at": 1691401831, "comment_count": 79, "status": 1, "summary": "地狱地铁介绍地狱地铁是在你通关极地铁之后开放的全新难度关卡。地狱地铁分为3个难度，我们称它为弱、中、强。Q：地狱地铁掉落什么？A：掉落制作新装备所必须的“天然石”，你想做地铁新套装必须能获取这个材料。", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_700/h_1117/202/63428/2022/10/24/137512.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_705/h_1142/202/63428/2022/10/24/377811.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_630/h_839/202/63428/2022/10/24/744919.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 27, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 40408, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "江西省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 13, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 576728, "content": "<div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">地狱地铁介绍<br></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">地狱地铁是在你通关极地铁之后开放的全新难度关卡。</span><div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"700\" data-height=\"1117\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_700/h_1117/202/63428/2022/10/24/137512.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_700/h_1117/202/63428/2022/10/24/137512.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">地狱地铁分为3个难度，我们称它为弱、中、强。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"705\" data-height=\"1142\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_705/h_1142/202/63428/2022/10/24/377811.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_705/h_1142/202/63428/2022/10/24/377811.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：地狱地铁掉落什么？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：掉落<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">制作新装备所必须的“天然石”</span>，你想做地铁新套装必须能获取这个材料。除此之外还掉落<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">融化剂</span>和一些金币箱子。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：融化剂是干嘛用的？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：融化剂是用于制作新附魔石的道具。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">100个旧附魔石+1个融化剂=1个刻印石</span>（新附魔石）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"630\" data-height=\"839\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_630/h_839/202/63428/2022/10/24/744919.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_630/h_839/202/63428/2022/10/24/744919.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：刻印石又是干嘛的？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：刻印石有2个用途：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.洗附魔</span>（100%必出S且有概率出现彩色S词条）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.做地铁套装</span>（每做一个地铁套装备需要消耗1个刻印石）</div></span></div></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">地铁套装</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"647\" data-height=\"1825\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_647/h_1825/202/63428/2022/10/24/722922.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_647/h_1825/202/63428/2022/10/24/722922.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">（图中均为+0数据！不是+15！）</span><br style=\"\">可以很容易看出新装备的特点：<br style=\"\">1.拥有3个属性条，目前的老装备都只有2个词条。<br style=\"\">2.数值极高，一条比现在两条加起来还高。最明显的：武器最高达到2700攻击<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：地铁套制作消耗什么材料？</span><br style=\"\">A：1颗刻印石+100个天然石+金币制作，出的<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">装备品质是随机的。</span></span><br style=\"\"></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"695\" data-height=\"588\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_695/h_588/202/63428/2022/10/24/864031.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_695/h_588/202/63428/2022/10/24/864031.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：地铁套出了，现在的T0装是不是就废了？</span><br style=\"\">A：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不能说废了，只能说废了一半</span>，因为新地铁装备的C级已经碾压旧T0A级，意思就是说做一件新装备，你的老装备就要下岗一件，等你做齐15套地铁装，那旧T0可以宣告退役了。</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"3862\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_3862/202/63428/2022/10/24/815697.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_3862/202/63428/2022/10/24/815697.jpg\"></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">感受一下地铁套的强度</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/426859.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/426859.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/330218.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/330218.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/259558.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/259558.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/582477.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/582477.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/903477.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/903477.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/486270.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/486270.jpg\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"864\" data-height=\"1920\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/229951.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_864/h_1920/202/63428/2022/10/25/229951.jpg\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">新附魔词条<br></span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1095\" data-height=\"640\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1095/h_640/202/63428/2022/10/25/974892.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1095/h_640/202/63428/2022/10/25/974892.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\">新彩色附魔表如上图所示。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(205, 5, 5);\">（地狱地铁和新附魔系统开放后，A/S附魔概率<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">永久提升3倍</span>，不会再有3倍附魔活动了）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：如何才能洗出新附魔词条？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：使用刻印石时有概率出现彩色词条，约为普通S词条出现概率的20~25%</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：新S附魔只能从旧S附魔上面洗出来吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：是的，换句话说：</div><div class=\"div-img\">你要有旧S附魔，你才<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">有可能有</span>新S附魔</div><div class=\"div-img\">你没有旧S附魔，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">一定没有</span>新S附魔</div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">典中典Q＆A</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：地铁套出了，T0装备的地位会如何？还需要花40W币去买吗？</span><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A：T0装备彻底沦为过渡装，但不会完全退役，但值得注意的是：<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 5, 5); font-weight: bold;\">不需要去竞技场商店买了，40W币太贵了，你愿意花这么多币去买一件过渡装吗？</span>对于开券随机出的T0装备，依然可以去升级，地铁装备完全替换T0装备至少需要6-12个月时间，你难道这段时间就不穿装备了？</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：那我现在的竞技场点数买什么呢？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">全部All in 进化石</span></span>，再买T0A=大冤种</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：我新手打不过地狱地铁怎么办？是不是永远拿不到地铁装备了？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A：打不过也没事，因为地狱地铁有3个难度，你只需要打得过简单难度就可以做地铁套装，只是你的天然石获取速度会比别人落后一些。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">需要说明的是：</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 5, 5);\">其实做地铁新装备<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">缺的不是天然石，是刻印石</span>，因为刻印石1颗就需要100个旧附魔石，真正的缺口在这里！</span>你不会缺融化剂、也不会缺天然石，你只会缺旧附魔石，即缺刻印石。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：有必要从现在开始屯附魔石吗？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A：分几种人：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.附魔已经成型了的，不怎么缺S附魔了：</span>那你可以屯附魔石，不用参加后面的3倍活动，直接存着等新地铁就行了。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.附魔还没成型的人：</span>我建议你继续参加3倍活动，你不把附魔质量提上去，地狱地铁你大概率打不过，打不过就没有这么多烦恼了，那你还屯个毛线附魔石。只有你S附魔质量够了，你才能过地狱地铁！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">Q：怎么样的附魔算成型了？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">A：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">武器、防具、饰品的1<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">/</span>2/3号位各有15-20条S附魔</span>，也就是说你的总S附魔数量要在135~180条左右，才称得上是成型，达标之前你永远是没成型的。</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_700/h_1117/202/63428/2022/10/24/137512.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_705/h_1142/202/63428/2022/10/24/377811.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_630/h_839/202/63428/2022/10/24/744919.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/image